# The open-marker conjunct of Armed dropped: the core's own guard, distinct from
# H's guarantee. An activation arms while a hand-off window is open, and its live
# advance passes a foreign record the window allocated below its own append. It
# edits the Armed predicate, so it names no perturbed action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestArmsUnderOpenMarker
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms while L's marker is open

--- FIND
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an open marker does not hold the advance.
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
--- END
